    <p>Email sign-in uses Supabase Auth links. Google or GitHub sign-in is offered only when the provider is enabled. Website accounts currently use a separate authentication service from the desktop IDE account; signing in on the website does not by itself sign you in to the desktop app or grant access to GitHub or an AI provider.</p>

